<center><blockquote>Includes DAB-1 Antenna Adapter</blockquote></center>

<p>The RetroSound® San Diego RetroRadio™ is the most technologically advanced radio ever made for your classic {{ ymm }}.  San Diego has a built-in DAB/DAB+ tuner to receive digital audio broadcasts.  (Note: We are including our DAB1 antenna adapter which allows your standard AM/FM antenna to receive the digital DAB signal). Our DAB1 or a DAB specific antenna is required to enjoy DAB broadcasts.  San Diego is Made-For-iPod®/iPhone®, offering complete control of your Apple device through the radio.</p>
<p>DAB (Digital Audio Broadcasting) is the digital audio standard for many countries in Europe, the Middle East and Asia Pacific.</p>
<p>San Diego features built-in Bluetooth® connectivity for hands-free phone calls and wireless audio streaming, including wireless browsing from any Android®-based phone.   San Diego features a 32,000 color display to customize your radio to your vehicle's interior. Two USB ports for iPod®/iPhone® or USB flash drives loaded with MP3 or WMA files plus two standard auxiliary inputs are provided. </p>
<p>San Diego has a built-in 25 watts x 4 channel power RMS MOSFET amplifier as well as front and rear RCA pre-outs, plus subwoofer output, to add external amplifiers.  It mounts seamlessly into your dash thanks to RetroSound®'s patented InfiniMount adjustable bracket system.</p>
